"Summarizing complex information"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Breaking down concepts and explaining them clearly"],"\n"],"\n",["P",{"class":"mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-semibold"},"Problem-Solving & Reasoning"]],"\n",["UL",{"class":"mb-3 ml-5 list-disc space-y-1"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Math and logic problems"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Coding and debugging assistance"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Brainstorming ideas and strategies"],"\n"],"\n",["P",{"class":"mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-semibold"},"Planning & Productivity"]],"\n",["UL",{"class":"mb-3 ml-5 list-disc space-y-1"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Creating outlines, to-do lists, and plans"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Helping organize thoughts and projects"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Offering suggestions and recommendations"],"\n"],"\n",["P",{"class":"mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-semibold"},"Learning & Education"]],"\n",["UL",{"class":"mb-3 ml-5 list-disc space-y-1"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Explaining topics step-by-step"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Creating study materials or practice questions"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Adapting explanations to different levels of understanding"],"\n"],"\n",["P",{"class":"mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-semibold"},"Creative Work"]],"\n",["UL",{"class":"mb-3 ml-5 list-disc space-y-1"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Storytelling and worldbuilding"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Generating ideas for projects, names, or concepts"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Helping with scripts, dialogue, and narratives"],"\n"],"\n",["P",{"class":"mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-semibold"},"Everyday Help"]],"\n",["UL",{"class":"mb-3 ml-5 list-disc space-y-1"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Recipe ideas and cooking tips"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"Travel planning suggestions"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"General advice on everyday decisions"],"\n"],"\n",["P",{"class":"mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words"},"A few things to keep in mind:"],"\n",["UL",{"class":"mb-3 ml-5 list-disc space-y-1"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"My knowledge has a cutoff of January 2026, so I may not know very recent events."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"I can't browse the internet, access files, or take actions in the real world."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"break-words"},"I'll always try to be honest about what I know and don't know."],"\n"],"\n",["P",{"class":"mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words"},"What would you like to work on? Feel free to ask me anything!"]]]]],[[2,14]]]],["FORM",{"class":"flex items-end gap-2 border-t bg-background p-3"},[[2,17]],["BUTTON",{"data-slot":"button","data-variant":"default","data-size":"default","class":"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-clip-padding text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&_svg]:pointer-events-none [&_svg]:shrink-0 [&_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 h-8 gap-1.5 px-2.5 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2","type":"submit","disabled":""},"Send"]]]]]]],["SECTION",{"aria-label":"Notifications alt+T","tabindex":"-1","aria-live":"polite","aria-relevant":"additions text","aria-atomic":"false","data-react-aria-top-layer":"true"}],[[28,18]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":81678.181,"wallTi